{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_09_j",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:ff161f4c5e88dfb1e965d53e87a041656b07ebe8aae109dd0143c81f80ebfb70",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_j:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0d4265d505540fb717b32c6d3e37edac5cb0771ce62ced773caf26300f62f2a",
      "text": "话说回来，我还没好好道过谢呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_j:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ff28fe0c99fd29c1026721f4c9c9219e44b12e8598706f66e34f5e1bfb36082",
      "text": "虽然现在才说有点迟，但愿意跟我一起成为偶像……\n谢谢你，玄武！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_j:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fef95112a427769e6b51825b09baa3e70aa59805ab5c0f3185df0d38b322e7bc",
      "text": "我也该向你道谢。能和你这样的汉子\n一起做偶像，我感到很自豪。朱雀！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_j:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea3511d8f62dda239de0f8fdaf21059e4cc991ec07b0cc9854b2114c5db38dfd",
      "text": "……喵——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_j:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b03707b066324217090074e51c48f1bf01c5c20dd42a55d9c1cfab90cf27d3d8",
      "text": "好痛！抱歉啊喵子。\n吵醒你了不好意思。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_j:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1614c50748aba4486fe7dd9da7d4a42083fe1411d319adde352c27cc29e0b08a",
      "text": "哎呀朱雀，快把喵子抱住。\n再靠过来一点我喷嚏就要停不下来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_j:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:304bee9b4b62549f729eeacf3bba6159865a8143b9e922e29f7efe44e804d937",
      "text": "我知道啦。\n来，喵子的床在这边。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_j:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71d1bf1cc24fd67e7b6abfba83f7ca39efc569754f1158ca62e845ce107f5b22",
      "text": "好了，既然都被喵子嫌吵挨训了，\n我们也差不多该睡了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_j:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3932f71d827fc4a3b8ac5c323b8bbee77686b76f93bf5092baa2bdac970f60cb",
      "text": "噢，也是呢。\n……明天我们315 Pro可是第一个打头阵出场。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_j:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc2c03e8cb0b8aec5edc15e105e7e1f50cd0f891f10c9dd5db690922c7ff8d9f",
      "text": "就由我们，让全场、让业界、\n不，让全世界都大吃一惊吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_09:1_4_001_09_j:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ab4ff24204e5bd66c3882ce1419454e8fb8b611b5593d241b7bebac57a5bf94",
      "text": "言行一致。凭我们神速一魂，绝对办得到！\n去闹个天翻地覆吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
